TV Program Scheduler/Recorder Scripts Suite
===========================================

Dependency
----------
- bash
- at
  For scheduling TV recording task.
- screen
  For setting Baud Rate of ttyUSB0 to Arduino

Installation
------------
Just copy to /root/tv-scheduler folder

Setup
-----
- If you want, you can setup file path in tv-scheduler.conf
- Enable atd
  # systemctl enable atd
- Run tv-rec-init.sh before using tv-scheduler
  This script must be executed every time the computer is restarted.

Run Scheduler
-------------
- Add a one time recording task:
  # ./tv-sch.sh 2021-05-21 21:00 95m 65 音速小子
- Add a daily recording task:
  # ./tv-sch-D.sh 12:00 60m 10 中視午間新聞

Check Schedule
--------------
atq
at -c 5		# show the detail of job 5
